# Airflow Configuration
# =====================

# User ID for Airflow containers (Linux users should set this to their UID)
# Run `id -u` to get your user ID on Linux/Mac
AIRFLOW_UID=50000

# Airflow image name (defaults to the one in docker-compose.yaml)
# AIRFLOW_IMAGE_NAME=apache/airflow:3.1.6

# Admin credentials for Airflow Web UI
_AIRFLOW_WWW_USER_USERNAME=airflow
_AIRFLOW_WWW_USER_PASSWORD=airflow

# Additional pip requirements (optional)
# _PIP_ADDITIONAL_REQUIREMENTS=apache-airflow-providers-amazon

# Project directory (defaults to current directory)
# AIRFLOW_PROJ_DIR=.
AIRFLOW__SIMPLE_AUTH_MANAGER__PASSWORDS=admin:airflow